UIRecyclableScrollView:GetCacheCellList {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIRecyclableScrollView.h#UIRecyclableScrollView:GetCacheCellList
    src   "Get all created cell object array. Note this just directly return cell list, which is not in user-friendly order (first one may not at the left-top position).\nUse \"GetUserFriendlyCacheCellList\" can get the cell list in good order."
    text  "获取所有已创建的单元格对象数组。注意，此处直接返回单元格列表，其顺序并不友好（第一个可能不在左上角位置）。\n使用“GetUserFriendlyCacheCellList”可获取顺序友好的单元格列表。"
    state machine
}

UIRecyclableScrollView:GetCellItemByDataIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIRecyclableScrollView.h#UIRecyclableScrollView:GetCellItemByDataIndex
    src   "RecyclableScrollView will create a cache list to store cell object, use data-index to get the cell that represent the data.\n@param Index         data index\n@param OutResult                     The cell object which represent the data. could be null if there is no cell represent the data (not in render range)\n@return true if have valid result, false otherwise"
    text  "RecyclableScrollView会创建一个缓存列表来存储单元格对象，通过data-index获取表示该数据的单元格。\n@param Index         数据索引\n@param OutResult                     表示该数据的单元格对象。如果没有单元格表示该数据（不在渲染范围内），则可能为null\n@return 如果有有效结果则返回true，否则返回false"
    state machine
}

UIRecyclableScrollView:GetUserFriendlyCacheCellList {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIRecyclableScrollView.h#UIRecyclableScrollView:GetUserFriendlyCacheCellList
    src   "Get all created cell object array, with user-friendly order (left-top is the first one, and right-bottom is last)."
    text  "获取所有已创建的单元格对象数组，按便于使用的顺序排列（左上为第一个，右下为最后一个）。"
    state machine
}

