UIRecyclableScrollView:ScrollToByDataIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIRecyclableScrollView.h#UIRecyclableScrollView:ScrollToByDataIndex
    src   "Try to scroll the scrollview so the cell item with InDataIndex can sit at center. Will clamp it in valid range.\n@param InDataIndex Cell data index.\n@param InEaseAnimation true-use tween animation to make smooth scroll, false-immediate set.\n@param InAnimationDuration Animation duration if InEaseAnimation = true."
    text  "尝试滚动滚动视图，使数据索引为InDataIndex的单元格项居中显示。会将其限制在有效范围内。\n@param InDataIndex 单元格数据索引。\n@param InEaseAnimation true-使用补间动画实现平滑滚动，false-立即设置。\n@param InAnimationDuration 当InEaseAnimation为true时的动画时长。"
    state machine
}

